window.products.push({"id":920030,"name":"LUCKUP Cellular Shades Cordless Honeycomb Blackout Blinds for Windows, Pull Down Shades for Bedroom Home, Room Darkening, Easy to Install 42'' W x 64'","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":67.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ekroU6U7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Excellent Material: The honeycomb shades are made of high-quality non-woven fabric. Equipped with built-in aluminum foil coating, cellular shades can block sunlight to darken the room and perfect your privacy. Honeycomb Design: Thanks to the special honeycomb structures, the blackout cellular shades can reduce noise effectively, insulate temperature, and save energy, provide a comfortable resting environment. Cordless Design: The cordless honeycomb blinds for windows create a safer environment for your children and pets. Come with a smooth glide spring system, bottom up cellular shades can be easily raised or down with fingers, or stay at whatever position you want. How to Install: For inside mount, the width of blackout cellular blinds should be at least 1/4\" narrower than window(wall to wall). The depth should be at least 2\". For outside mount, the fabric portion should completely cover the window. Double Color: Our grey-white cordless cellular shades have two colors on two sides, and both sides can be installed. Honeycomb design can be used as an elegant decoration, so the pull down blinds are suitable for bedroom, living room, bathroom, and kitchen. Product Details: 42\"W x 64\"H. Due to the aluminum cover on top, the width of the fabric portion is 41.5\" in fact. You can clean the waterproof cellular shades effortlessly, just wipe with a damp cloth or feather duster when it gets dirty.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ekroU6U7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LUCKUP","source_asin":"B0BFQ5RL9T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920030","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFQ5RL9T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFQ5RL9T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920031,"name":"ZPC Stainless steel ice cubes, stainless steel frozen cubes, reusable ice cubes, whiskey tartar, with ice tongs, for whiskey, bourbon, scotch, vodka, ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414XQJ2bGHS._AC_.jpg","description":"Stainless steel whiskey ice cubes are small ice cubes. You can store them in the refrigerator and put them in whiskey or other beverages without using ice cubes. The biggest advantage of using stainless steel ice cubes is that your beverage will not be diluted like traditional ice cubes. Our stainless steel cooling stone is one of the best cooling stones on the market. It contains a non-toxic gel in each cube, which can keep the beverage extra cold. You usually only need to freeze these cubes for 4-5 hours, then pour them into a drink or whiskey and enjoy the undiluted cooling. These stones are very durable and easy to wash and clean. Ordinary ice cubes have high requirements for water quality, and are easy to carry viruses and bacteria during the freezing process, which is unsafe and unhygienic. Whiskey ice cubes made of food-grade stainless steel are filled with frozen liquid, which is more durable than ordinary ice cubes, is less prone to bacteria breeding, and is more hygienic. important Notice: 🙅‍✖Do not swallow or eat them, keep them away from your children! Keep the original taste of the drink Can be used for all kinds of whiskey. For example: Irish whiskey, Scotch whiskey, Japanese whiskey, Tennessee whiskey, rye or bourbon whiskey and Odeka, liqueur, white wine, etc. Can be used for all kinds of drinks. For example: coffee, soda, tea juice. Will not dilute the beverage, nor will it affect the flavor of the beverage. The stylish and luxurious appearance can make it a luxurious gift for your family and friends. The perfect gift for birthdays, Valentine's Day, Father's Day, Mother's Day, Thanksgiving Day, Halloween, Christmas, New Year and other holidays. Can be used at home, office and party to enjoy relaxing time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/414XQJ2bGHS._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZPC","source_asin":"B0993FQGTP","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920031","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0993FQGTP","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0993FQGTP","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
