window.products.push({"id":920107,"name":"BABEYOND Vintage Bridal Feather Bouquet 1920s Ostrich Feather Fan Crystal Bridesmaid Bouquet 20s Gatsby Wedding Bouquet Flapper Accessories (White4)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XfPuaHiqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Material: Made of gorgeous thick feathers, crystal rhinestones, lace bands, and wooden handles. Size: Feather part: 11.8\" x 6.5\"/28cm x 16.51cm; Crystal decoration: 2.2\" x 2.2\"/5.59cm x 5.59cm; Handle: 5.1”/12.95cm. Features: Eye-catching marabou feather bouquet fan adds a unique glow to your vintage wedding. Lace-band tied handles and sparkling crystals make it more sophisticated. Occasions: Great for Gatsby themed wedding or party, 1920s costume balls, role play, tea parties, variety shows or any other special occasion. Also excellent for room decoration. Note: Feather fan can not be closed. Place fans in soft sunlight for a few hours or blow it with hot air for a few minutes so that the feathers will be fully plumped before using.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91XfPuaHiqL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BABEYOND","source_asin":"B082KJDD1T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920107","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082KJDD1T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082KJDD1T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
