window.products.push({"id":920158,"name":"Sunday Living Evaporative Air Cooler, 43'' Portable Cooling Fan w/Cooling & Humidification, 50° Oscillation, 4 Ice Packs, 3 Speed & 3 Mode Setting, 1.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716rrSa7-gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Function Air Cooling Fan - The evaporative air cooler is specially designed to combine air cooler with air cooler, comes with the 1.3 gallon water tank, it can create cold airflow and provides a much more comfortable environment for you in the hot summer. This portable air cooler comes with two water tanks on both the top and the bottom sides, no need to bend over, and 2 small ice boxes for top and 2 big ones fit on the bottom. 3 Mode & 3-Speed Settings - This cooling fan comes with 3 wind speed settings (low/middle/high) to give all the comfort you need. 3 types of the wind(normal/sleep/natural), no matter you are working, sleeping or doing something else, this portable swamp cooler will help you to choose the best wind. The sleep mode can intelligently help you adjust the wind speed, to ensure that you can enjoy a comfortable sleep environment. 50° Adjustable Oscillating Fan - The 50°Oscillation function covers a large angel of the space, allows the air in the room to be cooled at different angles, keeping the whole room cool and moist. Using the swing mode will make the air cooler fan more efficiently circulate the air around the room healthily. Convenient Dual Control & 12H Timer - Air cooler tower fan is equipped with both built-in touch control panel from the top and remote control, and the real-time temperature is displayed on the panel. Timer control function up to 12 hours, allows you to spend long summer nights peacefully. Portable & Space Saving Design - Standing 42 inches tall with a small 7 x 9 inches footprint, the sleek design is easy to fit in corners and tight spaces, which can provide you cool wind and also save your space. The convenient carry handle on the top make this portable evaporative cooler easy to move from room to room. A swamp cooler can be suitable for living room, bedroom, dorm and office. For safety care, remote control battery required is not included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/716rrSa7-gL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"5 SUNDAY LIVING","source_asin":"B09M2NN7KM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920158","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09M2NN7KM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09M2NN7KM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
