window.products.push({"id":920161,"name":"Leccod Upgrade Tank Top Hanger, Bra Hangers Space Saving Wooden 360° Rotating Non-Slip 24 Foldable Metal Hooks Closet Organizer for Camisole, Bathing ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":23.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jKFDyUuIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Sealed Rust Proof Hooks & One-piece Design】The strong chrome surface can effectively ensure a long time rust-proof effect. All hooks have smooth rounded ends with no sharp edges and won't tangle your precious lace, embroidery or silk-like fabrics when picking up clothes. The hook adopts NRT-SPT, different from the ordinary LSP-TPT, it can be rotated 360 ° but will not be separated from the hanger. The entire hanger is designed in one piece without any welding seams. 【Space Saving】This space saving hanger frees up limited drawer storage space, and the swivel hook can be fully unfolded for easy display of camisoles and bras, or fully folded to save space. And the parallel force hooks apply more even force than the vertically focused hooks, making it easier to access tank tops and bras without tangling them during use. A good choice for men's and women's small closet and college dorm room essentials for girls. 【Eco-friendly Natural Material】This delicate wood hanger is made of sturdy eco-friendly natural hardwood with a smooth and burr-free surface. Compared to those cheap thick plastic and metal hangers, there are no problems with plastic breaking, warping or paint being scratched off even after long periods of use. Rich dark walnut gives a sophisticated aesthetic that complements the chrome hardware. 【Extra Large Capacity】These extra wide hanger is approximately 15.8 x 5.1 x 0.7 inches and can be folded when not in use. It's slim and thin. The hangers have a total of 24 non-slip metal hooks, 12 on each side, 2.7 inches in hook length and 0.9 inches between two non-slip hooks, enough to display your tank tops, bras or ties, and the hooks can rotate 360°. 【Wide Compatible】The closet organizer rack fits most sizes of hanger rails and closet rods. It can be used to hang your tank top, bra, sports bra, camisole, bathing suit, strappy dress, scarf, kid's clothes, lingerie， tie, belt, crossbody shoulder bag, cap, hat, medal, key, jewelry, necklace, necktie and other item. All it takes is one hanger to get your closet in order.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71jKFDyUuIL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Leccod","source_asin":"B09WM7V9QX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920161","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09WM7V9QX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09WM7V9QX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
