window.products.push({"id":920199,"name":"Chefman Anti-Overflow Belgian Waffle Maker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":69.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lrqn81wOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DO DOUBLE DUTY: Save time without sacrificing personal preference. Our novelty waffle maker cooks two waffles at once with individual browning ability. Make a big batch of made-to-order waffles in half the time. MESS-FREE: Get the gourmet breakfast you crave without the added hassle and mess. Our uniquely designed anti-overflow moat allows for fluffy mouthwatering waffles without the time-consuming clean-up. PERFECT TIMING: Our waffle machine is preset with 7 shade settings so you can customize your waffle with the perfect amount of crunch. Ready indicator lights let you know when cooking is complete for a beautifully browned waffle. EASY-TO-CLEAN SURFACES: It's easy to keep your waffle maker Belgian style appliance looking like new with the non-stick plates and exterior that easily wipe down with a damp sponge or rag. FAST AND FUN: This round waffles maker whips up two 6-Inch waffles in minutes so can enjoy breakfast for one or a big batch at brunch in no time. Make meals faster with double the space to cook.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61lrqn81wOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Chefman","source_asin":"B0BNNCQVNW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920199","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BNNCQVNW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BNNCQVNW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920200,"name":"NEW!!! OTOTO - Ninja Board - Small Wood Cutting Board and Knife Set - Kitchen Gift for Chopping Fruits and Vegetables; Board made of Wood and Knife of","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fqti04uML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Designed for Ninja Skills & Kitchen Thrills- Don’t be deceived by its cuteness, the OTOTO Ninja Board Cutting Board & Knife set were designed for those quick slicing, dicing, & other ‘ings’ you do with fruits & vegetables. The ninja-shaped wood chopping board has a knife-friendly surface that minimizes impact on your blade & in turn, prolongs its sharpness & use. Always looking for your knife? The board has a knife slot! No more “I’m sure I placed it right there on the table!” moments. A Gift A Cut Above- Looking at wood cutting boards as a gift? Our board set is a cut above the rest! The unique shape and cute design are sure to bring a smile to anyone’s face, while the smooth and clean wood surface and a built-in slot for the knife aren’t bad too. It’s the perfect combination of fun and function. Give our cutting board set for any occasion: birthdays, housewarmings, weddings, and more. Or maybe you know a real Ninja? Give it as a retirement gift! Less Mess, Less Stress- Preparing a quick and easy meal? Use our cutting board set to cut all the ingredients you need for your solo or couple meals. Our board and knife size are ideal for such preparations - no need to bring out that long and heavy cutting board that is also a hassle to clean. Speaking of, the Ninja Board is not just for quick and easy use; it’s also quick and easy to maintain. Just wash with water and soap, then air-dry. It’s now ready for its next cutting mission. The Board That's Never Boring- Wood cutting boards for kitchen have other uses too. Use them as a serving tray for finger food such as biscuits, cheese, and the likes. Since ours is Ninja-inspired, why not serve your sushi, maki, or whatever food from the land of the rising sun on our product? If that’s not social media-worthy, we don’t know what is. It makes for an excellent conversational piece as well; that’s about five minutes less of awkwardness. You’re welcome. A Sprinkle of Fun- Ever heard of the one where they lived happily ever after? Well, that's always the story with OTOTO's household products. Why? Because everyday chores are no longer a bore when you've got adorable gadgets to explore! Our team strives to create functional products with a quirky and unexpected twist. We love sprinkling in a bit of fun and magic in all that we do and we hope you feel the same way too!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71fqti04uML._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OTOTO","source_asin":"B099ZTN86Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920200","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B099ZTN86Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B099ZTN86Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
