window.products.push({"id":920209,"name":"Endea Graduation Mixed Triple Color Tassel with Silver Bling Charm (Black/Silver/White, 2021)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-vL56TwcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"A GRADUATION CLASSIC. No graduation ceremony would be complete without the hallmark mixed graduation tassel with Bling Charm. Regardless of the age of the graduate, a tassel and year bling charm are essential pieces of the graduating experience! COMMEMORATIVE DATE DROP. Our mixed tassels come with a bling date drop to denote the year of your special achievement! MEETS US GRADUATION STANDARDS. The classic mixed graduation tassel measures 9 inches long and is standard for all graduation of any level in USA schools, colleges, and universities! SILVER YEAR BLING CHARM. With a free moving and lightweight date drop, this mixed graduation tassel celebrates the year of graduation! PERFECT SOUVENIR. Mixed Color Tassels look fantastic on graduation day, but this graduation classic is designed to be kept and treasured by graduates and family for years to come. Be proud of your academic achievement!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61-vL56TwcL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Endea Graduation","source_asin":"B08RVL2HGH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920209","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08RVL2HGH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08RVL2HGH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920210,"name":"Simplified Bedding All-in-one, Duvet Cover and Zip-Sheet Combination Easy to Make Bedding System, Queen, White Cotton Sateen,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617cmOyJwuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product Description Messy sleepers, lazy bed-makers, perfectionists: it’s time to get organized—so simply. Simplified Bedding is an integrated duvet cover + flat sheet system designed to make everything about your bed easier and more comfy. Simplified Bedding will refresh how you think about your bed and will, ultimately, streamline your bedding care and expedite each morning. Inspired by the tradition of European bedding, Simplified Bedding is the only patented bedding of its kind, combining a soft, simple-to-use duvet cover with a seamlessly zippered-in flat sheet. Experience the impact, every day From the Manufacturer NO more sheet tangles + Easy to make your bed Among other benefits, Simplified Bedding is designed to eliminate sheet tangles and provide easy-to-make bedding. *Banish tangles. Whether you get tangled during sleep or have to deal with untangling sheets to make the bed, a zipped-in flat sheet means no more mess. *Save hours, gain happiness. You will spend virtually no time making your bed and no time thinking you should have. Just get out and pull up the cover for a perfectly made bed. The benefits continue..... *Be aligned, every time. For the perfectionists or aspiring ones, you will likely shave at least 3 minutes off your morning routine trying to align the sheet and comforter. With discrete zippers and Velcro, it’s already done. *Deal with your duvet less. You can easily zip off the flat sheet for washing, and then reconnect it simply. Meanwhile, your duvet cover stays put, needing less washing. Less washing of the duvet cover=fewer duvet insertions and placement (and frustrations!). *Get really comfy. We source 100% percent cotton fabrics with 300 thread count for both the duvet cover and attached flat sheet. Super soft. For any season. Not to mention—our built-in corner ties keep the duvet in place and a better fit all around Duvet Cover and flat sheet stay aligned Discrete YKK zipper system connects the duvet cover and flat sheet so the two stay aligned during sleep and makeup. Keep your duvet cover clean In addition to securing the alignment of the two, the top fold-over sheet flap keeps dirt and oils from getting on the duvet cover. Limit shifting of the duvet/comforter inside the duvet cover With internal corner and middle ties, it is easy to tie your comforter/duvet inside the cover so there is limited shifting during sleep and makeup. Life’s complicated. Your bed shouldn’t be. Our mission is to make your bedding more simple, easy and comfortable. Simplified Bedding will refresh how you think about your bed and will, ultimately, streamline your bedding care and expedite each morning About the Startup Describe your product in 3 words. Bedding made easy How did you come up with the idea for this product? To me, there's always been something ultra-comfortable about the \"European\" way of sleeping—a fitted sheet on the mattress and a soft duvet cover over a warm down duvet or comforter without using a flat sheet. When I went away to college, this became my sleeping arrangement of choice. The absence of the flat sheet provided a simple, cozy and comfortable setting. I didn't get wrapped up in the sheet in the middle of the night or find it at the bottom of my bed each morning. It also offered a way to quickly make-up the bed each day (especially in the dorm and sleeping porch top bunks) without having to constantly adjust/align the top sheet and tuck it in. The only difficult part was the constant washing and drying of the duvet cover to ensure a clean bed. I hated taking the comforter in/out of the cover and then reinserting it every week. In 2007 during a trip to France with my husband, I was reintroduced to the ease and comfort of the European sleeping method sans flat sheet. It brought me back to my college years and how I missed the carefree way of sleeping. That night with much jetlag, I came up with the idea of my bedding system. I had figured out a way to deliver a detachable sheet on a duvet cover allowing for a better night's sleep, ease of cleaning and (the best part for every day) a perfectly made bed in seconds. Shortly thereafter, I got to work on my first of many prototypes and filed for my patent. Since then, we have been successfully making our integrated duvet cover + flat sheet bedding system products. We have many repeat customer that rave about our product. They love the concept, the simplicity and the convenience of the product. What makes your product special? Simplified is the only patented bedding product of its kind on the market. What has been the best part of your startup experience? I have learned so much with my startup experience. Running your own business, you have to be the expert in design, manufacturing decisions, marketing, sales, accounting and customer service. I would say the most rewarding part of it all is hearing the positive feedback from customers - I love it when people tell me my idea is genius!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/617cmOyJwuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Simplified Bedding","source_asin":"B00QHGK70Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920210","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00QHGK70Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00QHGK70Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
