window.products.push({"id":920221,"name":"Robot Vacuum and Mop Combo, Robotic Vacuum Cleaner, WiFi/Alexa/App, 2 in 1 Mopping Robot Vacuum Cleaner, Multiple Cleaning Modes, Slim, Quiet, Self-Ch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d5V-pHSrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Smart Voice and App Control: The robot vacuum cleaner can monitor the real-time cleaning route, control the cleaning direction, set the cleaning mode/mopping level/timed cleaning, etc. through the APP, or start and stop cleaning through Alexa voice commands. Smart IoT technology makes home life better. Compatible with Android, IOS, support 2.4GHz WiFi/Bluetooth. 2-in-1 Vacuum and Mopping: The robot vacuum and mop combo can quickly remove dust, paper scraps, and other garbage. Wiping function and 200ml electronically controlled water tank, uniform penetration, can run for up to 100 min, and wipe surface up to 1290ft². Just clean the trash can and water tank for a different cleaning experience. 100Min Runtime & Self-Charging: The robot vacuum and mop is equipped with a 2600 mAh lithium-ion high-performance battery that provides up to 100 minutes of noise-free cleaning performance, suitable for cleaning different floors such as tiles, wood floors, carpets, marble, etc. When the power of the sweeping robot is low or the cleaning is completed, it will automatically charge for fast battery life. Slim Design and Smart Protection: With the 2.81'' ultra-thin design, the robotic vacuum and mop combo can clean all corners and under furniture cleanly in all directions. A full suite of sensors gracefully avoids obstacles and stairs and quickly covers more ground. Ideal for Pet Families:Powerful suction and unique brushless suction port can easily remove dust and hair without fear of tangles, and triple HEPA filtration technology prevents fine dust particles from being released back into the indoor air. Provide the perfect cleaning experience for pet families.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71d5V-pHSrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MANVINS","source_asin":"B0B7Q81N8L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920221","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B7Q81N8L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B7Q81N8L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
