window.products.push({"id":920285,"name":"Pumpkin Pattern Melamine Plates - 7.5 inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EQ3Wy4YOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"One Hundred 80 Degrees values our retail customers and strives to create partnerships that highlight our products and protect our brand in the marketplace. To ensure this goal One Hundred 80 degrees is unilaterally instituting the following policies. Retailers must have a brick-and-mortar store, a booth within a larger storefront location or an active website with shopping cart (URL must be owned by the retailer). Products cannot be offered for resale through any third-party marketplaces such as Amazon, Etsy, eBay, Google Shopping, Sears, Newegg, Rakuten, and Wal-Mart or any other third-party page, internet auction or sales site. Products cannot be sold at second hand and/or thrift store businesses. Any exceptions to this policy must be approved by the company. One Hundred 80 degrees requires and an active mailing address, phone number and email address for all retailers. All items will be subject to MAP (minimum advertised price) pricing. The MAP price for 2021 will be 2.2 times the wholesale price of the item. MAP does not establish maximum advertised prices and retailers may offer items at any price in excess of MAP. The company may choose to discontinue its business relationship with retailers that do not follow this policy. The Glitterville brand continues to grow and gain national recognition. The company strives to maintain the integrity of the brand and manage the distribution of the product. As of January 2021, retailers new to the Glitterville line must be approved by the company in coordination with the retailer’s local independent sales representative. we do not allow our items sold to thrift or second hand retail businesses","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EQ3Wy4YOL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"One Hundred 80 Degrees","source_asin":"B07MH3PQ27","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920285","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MH3PQ27","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MH3PQ27","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920286,"name":"Woffit Under Bed Shoe Storage Organizer – Set of 2 Large Containers, Each Fit 12 Pairs of Shoes – Sturdy Box w/Strong Zipper & Handles – Underbed Orga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":27.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oRitImStL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"SIMPLE SHOE STORAGE SOLUTION – Shoe racks are nice, but they can only fit so many pairs of shoes. The trick to an organized home is making the most of small unused spaces. Use this shoe organizer to store 16 pairs of shoes & 4 pairs of boots under your bed. This shoes storage is the ideal solution for any woman with a shoe addiction or moms with too many kids shoes flying around the house. SET OF BOOTS & SHOES ORGANIZER’S – Most women and even guys have a ridiculous amount of shoes & boots. Fortunately, Woffit has produced a specialized storage solution for your shoe collection a set of both which fits a total of 20 pairs! Our organizer has been special made to fit most shoes PREMIUM FABRIC, DURABLE CONSTRUCTION – Forget those felt shoe storage that rip and tear easily. Woffit is made with the thickest kind of non-woven fabric ensuring extra durability and protection for expensive shoes. 2 Strong handles allow you to easily pull the organizer out from a shelf or under your bed, so you can grab the shoes and go! EASY ACCESS AND VISIBILITY – The seasons go by too quickly and you may need to access your shoes often. Our Shoe Bags have clear vinyl covers that offer excellent visibility. You or your kids can choose their shoes in an instant. Strong zippers make opening and closing smooth and easy, so you can take out or store your shoes without any frustration. 100% LIFETIME MONEY BACK GUARANTEE – Oh I don’t need another pair of shoes’... said no women ever! Don’t ever think you have too many shoes, all you need is more storage, and under the bed organizers is the perfect solution. However, if for any reason you are unsatisfied, we offer a lifetime money back guarantee. Your shoe collection is our priority","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81oRitImStL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Woffit","source_asin":"B0BFBZFXDS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920286","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BFBZFXDS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BFBZFXDS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
