window.products.push({"id":920340,"name":"Hand Woven Premium Mexican Yoga Blankets","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XwblYS07L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our Mexican blankets are hand woven and made of soft, absorbent cloth and are easily washable. These Premium Yoga Blankets come in several great colors and designs. Since these blankets are handmade in villages throughout Mexico, there may be some slight variations in the pattern from the picture shown. Mexican blankets are used frequently in Iyengar and restorative yoga practices. They can be used folded under sitting poses to cushion bones and joints, underneath you in repose positions to insulate from cold flooring, rolled or folded to provide support in poses, or just as a cover to warm you in Savasana. Our Premium Yoga Blankets are made with a tight weave, so these blankets are thicker and warmer than our Classic. In addition to their larger size, they will offer more cushioning and insulation. These blankets are also great for use at the beach, a picnic or to cover an outdoor table and of course for providing warmth as a blanket. <h4>Product Features</h4> The Premium Yoga Blanket measures 78\" long x 54\" wide and weighs approx. 3 pounds The Premium Yoga Blanket measures 78\" long x 54\" wide and weighs approx. 3 pounds Extra thick, soft, warm Extra thick, soft, warm Available in a variety of colors - click on inset photo to enlarge for details Available in a variety of colors - click on inset photo to enlarge for details Made of 50% Acrylic, 40% Polyester, 10% Cotton Made of 50% Acrylic, 40% Polyester, 10% Cotton Blankets are machine washable; tumble dry cool Blankets are machine washable; tumble dry cool Handmade in Mexico. Hand woven. Handmade in Mexico. Hand woven. .","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81XwblYS07L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Rolling Sands","source_asin":"B003FOCJQG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920340","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003FOCJQG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003FOCJQG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920341,"name":"EIFFEL TOWER","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.44,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610+Y38Yv3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Become your own chocolatier with CybrTrayd’s complete line of confectionary making supplies! We offer a variety of food-grade PETG plastic molds that are durable and can be reused for a multitude of projects. Create chocolates for all occasions using our traditional shapes for cookie and cake molds or invest in more elaborate 3-D designs. Each mold is sealed in a poly bag with CybrTrayd instructions imprinted on it. This will provide details on chocolate melting and molding for all our molds, including the hollow 3-D molds. In addition, we’ve provided some tips and tricks for getting the best possible results. All of our plastic designs can also be used for soap making. Additional directions are provided soap melt & pour techniques.To prevent any damage to your mold please wash by hand and do not put it in the dishwasher. These plastic molds are not meant to be used with hard candy. The molds are not suitable for children under 3 and should only be used by older children with adult supervision.Chocolates make great favors or treats for parties and other special occasions. Use the hearts, strawberries, rose and other flowers for romantic gestures such as wedding favors or a Valentine’s Day surprise. Trees, ornaments, candy canes and other festive references are perfect for the holiday season. All of our adorable baby molds are ideal for showers and gender reveal parties. You can also add pop sticks to some of the chocolates and create lollipop celebrations.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610+Y38Yv3L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CybrTrayd","source_asin":"B000EJRBAY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920341","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EJRBAY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EJRBAY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
