window.products.push({"id":920343,"name":"Digging Dolls: 1 lb Green Opal Rough Rocks from Madagascar - Large 1\"+ Raw Natural Stones for Arts, Crafts, Tumbling, Cabbing, Polishing, Wire Wrappin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ckZNJlYJL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"The Digging Dolls Brand of stones is owned by female rock hounds who care deeply about providing only the best quality and value with the most spectacular 100% natural stones on the market. When you order any authentic Digging Dolls product you can be certain that every order has been through a rigorous quality control process and only the best products are allowed to feature our Digging Dolls logo.This beautiful completely natural Green Opal rough is mined at a privately owned quarry in Madagascar specifically for the Digging Dolls. These breathtaking stones are captivating and can be used for arts, crafts, home decor, decoration, tumbling, gem mining, fountains, wire wrapping, jewelry making, reiki and more. Once you have the stones in your hands the innovative thoughts for their uses just spring to mind!About Digging Dolls Stone Pictures: To ensure your satisfaction all Digging Dolls images show random stones right out of the mine bags. We have noticed many other stone dealers hand select and picture only perfect stones then what is received is not at all close to what is pictured. We believe in letting you see the most accurate representation of the stones you are ordering possible (short of taking pictures of every bag which would be cost prohibitive). Due to this some stones in our pictures may not look flawless, since as natural earth mined stones they are very rarely ever flawless.Every stone is unique and you will not be receiving the exact stones in the pictures. As natural earth mined stones that formed over millions of years they will vary in size, color, shape and patterning. The most important thing to Digging Dolls is making sure our customers are thrilled with what they receive when ordering the Digging Dolls brand.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ckZNJlYJL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digging Dolls","source_asin":"B01NARUSAF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920343","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01NARUSAF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01NARUSAF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920344,"name":"M2cbridge Metal Facial Tissue Box Cover Holder Lay On Wall Mounted, Mirror Polishing 18/8 Stainless Steel (Rectangle)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QHjEhBDaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Stainless Steel Tissue Box gives you a modern way to store facial tissues in the bedroom, office, or living room. This tissue storage box is constructed from strong yet lightweight 18/8 stainless steel with mirror polishing steel finish for a stylish look Simply remove the facial tissues from a store-bought box and store them inside this stainless steel tissue holder to keep them easily accessible and neatly stored Features a hinged top lid that allows you to place your stack of tissues or napkins inside Approximate Dimensions (in inches): 9.8 L X 5.1 W X 2.9 H , Package includes 1x tissue holder + mount kits The surface color bright as a mirror","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71QHjEhBDaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"M2cbridge","source_asin":"B088H3PDBG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920344","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B088H3PDBG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B088H3PDBG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
