window.products.push({"id":920364,"name":"NDZHZEO Chicken Coffee Mug 11 OZ Large Handle Ceramic Tea Cup","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hcVzD+HOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"PRODUCT DESCRIPTIONTo fully enjoy a cup of hot coffee or soothing tea, you need a well-made and durable cup, this 11 ounces porcelain tableware coffe mugs help enjoy a completely satisfying drink experience anytime, anywhere!SPECIFICATIONMaterial: High-quality high temperature resistance ceramic.Capacity: 11oz/ 330ml.Care and cleaning: Dishwasher and hand-wash.Heat resistant: Can be used in microwave oven and hot plate.Humanized design: The large handle is finely welded, the cup mouth is smooth, and the coating is not easy to peel off.Occasions: Home, kitchen, hotel, office, dormitory, classroom, club or other area.WHY WE CHOOSE PORCELAIN?- Plastic and metal cups often leave their ingredients in the beverage to change the taste and properties, making you feel unsatisfied with the drinking experience.- Porcelain cup is a little expensive, but it is safer to use in all materials.- Porcelain mugs won't rust, stain, or get scratched up. They can be wiped down or hand washed. Clean quickly and is dishwasher-safe.PERFECT GIFT IDEAOur porcelain mugs comes nice boxed, perfect for as coffee mug, tea cup, milk cup, and other drinks cup. It is perfect as a gift for birthday, christmas, new year, anniversary, valentine's day, wedding, engagement, graduation, mother's day, father's day and more.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61hcVzD+HOS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NDZHZEO","source_asin":"B094TM9YYC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920364","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094TM9YYC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094TM9YYC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
