window.products.push({"id":920378,"name":"Adjustable Bed Frame Queen, Sweetnight Tranquil Adjustable Base with Bluetooth Wireless Syncing, Under Bed Light with Motion Sensor, Comfort Customise","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o8cZU-tiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The Sweetnight Tranquil adjustable bed frame is quality and reliable adjustable bed base that has all the features you need to customize your sleeping position. Size Available： - Twin XL: 39 x 80 Inches (Two Twin XL adjustable bed bases form a split king) - Full : 54 x 75 Inches - Queen : 60 x 80 Inches - Split California King: 72 x 84 Inches Notes: It is normal that there may be a slight variation in the actual size. Features include: - Wireless remote control settings include: head lift/down, foot lift/down, simultaneous head & foot lift/down, FLAT, ZG, ANTI SNORE, TV, LED, Memory Setting - Wireless remote control, Bluetooth APP - Creative and advanced night light design with motion sensor - Mattress fixing bar to keep the mattress in place - Ergonomic design for the dual USB ports - Easy to install, no tools required - 705 lb weight limit Warranty detail: - 10-year limited warranty - steel bed base. - 3-year limited warranty - FULL COVERAGE OF PARTS: Head lift/down the motor, leg lift/down the motor, control box, motion sensor, and USB ports are included. - 1-year limited warranty - remote control. Notes: The routine use of the electric bed should follow the guidance and content of the manual, and it is recommended not to use accessories that have not been approved by the manufacturer. Otherwise, the normal warranty will be not obtained. What's Inside? - Bed base x 1 - Wireless remote control x 1 & Batteries x 3 - Adjustable bed legs x 6 - Mattress bar x 3 - Power supply x 1 - Power cord x 1 - Side pocket x 1 - Motion Sensor x 2 Maintenance: - It is not recommended that the electric bed lifting motor is continuously raised and lowered for more than 2 minutes during the 18 minutes since the service life of the motor will be affected. - The motor needs to be rested for at least 18 minutes after being run continuously for more than 2 minutes before running again. - To extend the service life of electric beds and mattresses, it is recommended to avoid long-term direct sunlight. Cleaning： - Clean with ordinary dry cloth or soft brush. Remark： - To avoid jams and injuries, children and pets are not allowed to hide and play under the electric bed. - Children and incapacitated adults are not allowed to operate the electric bed alone without the supervision of a guardian or caregiver.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o8cZU-tiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Sweetnight","source_asin":"B0B5NC9RSH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920378","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5NC9RSH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5NC9RSH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
