window.products.push({"id":920486,"name":"21 Pack Reusable Storage Bags BPA Free, Leak-proof Freezer Bags (7 Reusable Gallon Bags + 7 Reusable Sandwich Bags + 7 Reusable Snack Bags) Lunch Bags","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":21.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gyeg85VFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"FOOD GRADE MATERIAL & ECO-FRIENDLY: KITHELP BPA free reusable storage bags are with top quality! They made of premium food-grade PEVA material, PVC-free, lead-free, chloride-free & phthalates free, safe and healthy! 21 PACK & EXTRA DURABLE: Choose KITHELP 21 Pack premium reusable bags, we offer 3 different sizes for different needs, each size has 7 packs, they are perfect for you and your family. LEAK PROOF&DOUBLE WELD EDGES: Our reusable food storage bags are designed with upgraded double closures that are super air-tight, leak-proof and hygienic , perfect for storing and preserving both solid food and liquid food, perfect for home and travel.And they are designed with upgraded double weld edges, which make the lunch bags very durable and sturdy. The zippers are friendly for kid and old people to open and close. FREEZER SAFE&EASILY CLEANING: KITHELP reusable freezer bags are perfect for refrigerator storage. What's more, the reusable storage bags are super convenient to clean.Hand Wash with mild water and little soap, and then dry with a towel or put it on a cup for next use. NOT for dishwasher & microwave,Please do not use it for food that is too hot. MEET ALL YOUR NEEDS: The extra large reusable gallon bags (11.8x11 inch) are perfect for storing meats,frozen foods,cereal,steak,office supplies.The large size reusable sandwich bags (8.6x7.6 inch）& medium size washable snack bags (8.6x5.3 inch) are great for snacks, lunch, sandwiches, vegetables, fruit, babies food, jewelry, cosmetics, toys, stationery, travel and home organization. The reusable storage bags are transparent, you can see the contents inside easy and quick.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81gyeg85VFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KITHELP","source_asin":"B0BKRXV62R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920486","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BKRXV62R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BKRXV62R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
