window.products.push({"id":920530,"name":"WNOMDY Bath Stone Mats Diatomaceous Earth Bath Mat Fast Water Drying Super Absorbent Diatomite Mat with Non-Slip for Bathroom Shower Floor,Kitchen Abs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":34.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-IOmP-ZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fast drying: the porous structure of the diatomaceous earth bath mat itself has super water absorption, wet footprints will disappear automatically in about 15 seconds, saying goodbye to the traditional wet floor, you can keep your bathroom dry and hygienic at all times. Environmentally friendly material: Diatomaceous earth is a natural and innovative material without any chemical additives, natural and safe. Diatomaceous earth floor mats are sturdy and durable, compared with fabric bath mats, it has a longer service life and does not smell after a long time. There may be a trace of powder on the surface of the mat when you open the box, please wipe it with a wet towel and use it. Super anti-slip: the stone mat is equipped with a non-slip pad underneath, the surface on the diatomaceous earth bath mat is striped texture effect, effectively increasing the friction, can play a super anti-slip wear-resistant effect, effectively reducing the risk of slipping and falling. For the sake of the elderly and children at home, do not have to worry about slipping and falling this problem. Perfect home furnishings: simple and exquisite design style, natural and safe diatomaceous earth bath stone mat provides a perfect home environment for us to use it in: bathroom, bathtub, pet mat, kitchen, kitchenware draining rack, swimming pool and many other wet washing areas. Easy to clean: Daily cleaning of the natural diatomaceous earth bath stone mat is simple, just rinse with water or wipe with a damp cloth; stubborn stains can be used with sandpaper and will be as good as new after a few minutes of drying. It must be placed on a solid and flat surface, and cannot be used on uneven ground or soft ground. Warm tip: If the received mat is damaged or broken, please feel free to contact us for replacement.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81-IOmP-ZUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WNOMDY","source_asin":"B09X97YJR9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920530","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09X97YJR9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09X97YJR9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920531,"name":"Santas Christmas Envelope Seals (4 Designs) - Set of 144 1-1/2\" Diameter Self-Adhesive, Flat-Sheet Holiday Sticker Seals","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ebCAqREpL._AC_.jpg","description":"Let Santa deliver a sleigh full of merriment along with yourholiday mail! He gives a festive presentation and a flair of fun toyour envelopes or package wraps, gift tags or bags. Your SantaEnvelope Every Day Envelope Seals come in a set of 144 self-adhesive Every Day Envelope Seals, measuring1 1/2\" across.Susan Winget","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51ebCAqREpL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Colorful Images","source_asin":"B079VSRYCH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920531","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B079VSRYCH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B079VSRYCH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920532,"name":"BERMINO Sheer Curtains Voile Grommet Semi Sheer Curtains for Bedroom Living Room Set of 2 Curtain Panels 54 x 72 inch Light Yellow","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SAUBfMZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our sheer curtains will add interest and elegance to any setting. We provide multiple sizes and various attractive colors to widen your choices. These voile curtains can be hung using a simple rod. These sheer curtains can be an added decorative touch when paired with solid curtains, or can be a charming, elegant design element when hung all on their own. Machine washable with cold water for easy care.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71SAUBfMZdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BERMINO","source_asin":"B07K3ZTLPT","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920532","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07K3ZTLPT","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07K3ZTLPT","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920533,"name":"Oregon Stoneware Studio Bee Honeypot, Whipping Cream","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HgQZDX-7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These beautiful stoneware honey pots are hand thrown in Oregon and offered in a variety of glazes. They're adorned with hand-cast pewter faceplates (also made in Oregon) and include a wooden dipper. Not just for honey, you can also use them to store sugar, jam or salt. Since 2007, Carl Warne has been the exclusive potter for Crosby & Taylor Stoneware. That company is now focusing on their premium hand cast pewter designs and the stoneware division, led by Carl, has become Oregon Stoneware Studio. The two companies still work hand-in-hand, and Carl's pieces continue to be accented with Crosby & Taylor's premium pewter hardware. Due to handcrafting, variations and minor imperfections should be expected and confirm the artisan character of the work.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HgQZDX-7L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oregon Stoneware Studio","source_asin":"B0106UWG6O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920533","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0106UWG6O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0106UWG6O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920534,"name":"Hallmark Keepsake Christmas Ornament 2019 Year Dated, Sparkling Poinsettia Ornament, Gemstone and Metal","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":49.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jyISd-VrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring the beauty of the signature Christmas bloom to your tree with this brilliant poinsettia Christmas tree ornament. Sparkling red, yellow and green gemstones set in a metal base turn this classic holiday symbol into a stunning decoration that will add an elegant touch to any branch. Designed by Ruth Donikowski, this metal Christmas tree ornament features gemstones. Pre-packaged in a box for easy gift giving, preservation and storage. Dated 2019 in copyright. With unparalleled artistry and exceptional detail, each festive and collectible Keepsake Ornament is made for years of celebrations. From preserving precious memories to commemorating special milestones and interests, there's a Hallmark ornament for everyone on your gift list. Hallmark has been your family-owned creator of greeting cards, gifts, gift wrap and more for over 100 years. We take deep pride in helping individuals connect in just the right way. Metal Christmas tree ornament is lead-free and measures 3. 5\" W x 3. 36\" H x 0. 25\" D.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91jyISd-VrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Hallmark Keepsake","source_asin":"B07NDHMCB5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920534","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07NDHMCB5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07NDHMCB5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":920535,"name":"Bernardin Mason Jars - 250 mL - Wide","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F1hpqlF9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"These short profile mason jars have textured surfaces. The jars are ideal for home canning salmon, salsa, relish, chutney, jam, pickles, and other specialities. The straight-sided jars are also great for freezing foods. Screw bands can be reused, but SNAP lids are designed for one-time use only.Pack of 12 mason jars and 12 2-piece lids (SNAP lids and screw bands)Size: 250 mL, wide mouth (86 mm) Colour/Pattern: Silver-tone lid and screw bandCapacity: 250 millilitres/8.4 ounces (half pint)Dimensions: 2-2/3\"HMaterials: Glass jars with metal lidsCare: Jars are dishwasher safeProduct of United StatesFor best results, fill hot jar with prepared recipes, leaving recommended headspace. Wipe jar rim and threads with a clean, damp cloth removing any stickiness. Center hot SNAP lid on jar. Apply screw band just until fingertip tight; do not overtighten. After processing, remove jars from canner and set upright on a towel in a draft-free place. Do not retighten screw bands or check for seal while jars are hot. Cool processed jars upright, undisturbed for 24 hours. After 24 hours, check seals. Sealed lids curve downward and do not move when pressed. (Any unsealed jars should be reprocessed or refrigerated.) For all sealed jars, remove screw bands; wipe and dry bands and jars. Store screw bands separately or replace loosely on jars, as desired.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F1hpqlF9L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bernardin","source_asin":"B000FDOSYQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920535","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000FDOSYQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000FDOSYQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
