window.products.push({"id":920578,"name":"Food Thermometer, Meat Instant Read Digital Cooking Thermometer, Voice Broadcasting Foldable Temperature Probe,IP66 Waterproof, Suitable for Outdoor B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eUa7ADwYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Let you have perfect cooking skill, “ The temperature is under my control”！ This is a multi-function, low power consumption, high-precision, safe and convenient food thermometer, suitable for a variety of cooling/heating food processing, a variety of meat, liquid temperature measurement. It can be used in outdoor barbecue, baby milk water, cold drink , baking, kitchen cooking etc. Specification Temperature range：-30℃～300℃（-22℉～572℉） Temperature resolution：0.1℃ / 0.1℉ Accuracy：±1℃(1.8℉) at 0℃～ 200℃( 32℉～392℉) Others ±2℃(3.6℉) Power supply：2 AAA batteries Probe size：SUS304 φ4×108mm LCD screen size：43×22mm  Product size：172×37×22mm Weight: about 88g (excluding battery) Function & Features 1. Product certifications：CE；RoHS；FDA；FCC；WEEE 2. Whole product dustproof & waterproof： IP66  3. Voice broadcast current temperature. The sound is loud and clear, it’s more convenient for the elderly with presbyopia.  6. Lights of different colors remind current temperature, advanced warning, more intuitive and more timely. LED 3 colors (RGB) backlight function: The light is blue during temperature measurement on normal operation; it’s green light when it is close to the alarm temperature; it’s red light when it up to the alarm temperature,.  5. Fast read, could get accurate data in 3~5s  6. With magnet at back to absorb; with hanging hole to hang  7. Foldable probe, high safety, hard to break or hurt people; convenient storage and save space  8. Power on at 45°, 180° rotated at different angles.  9. Temperature℃ / ℉ switch function to meet different people's habits. 10. MAX/MIN，maximum and minimum value query function. 11. Temperature HOLD function, can lock the temperature when the measurement is finished, to avoid the temperature changing when the probe leaves the object. 12. Auto power off 10 minutes no operation.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51eUa7ADwYL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LS","source_asin":"B07S8B72F4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920578","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S8B72F4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S8B72F4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
