window.products.push({"id":920733,"name":"NimaTea Tea Mug with Infuser and Lid for Loose Tea Brew. Made of Borosilicate Glass and Stainless Steel Strainer Wraps with a Green Silicone Band. 16.","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7152V3cJWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NimaTea Tea Mug with Glass Infuser is great for all types of tea whether it is loose tea leaves or tea bags. It is used as a single serving teapot with infuser to brew your favorite black or green tea, hot or iced. It can also be used to brew coffee as well. You can brew a cup of gourmet tea blend or floral tea infusion and watch the entire steeping process through the crystal clear glass mug. This provides you a wonderful tea-time experience while you sit and relax your mind whenever you feel like it. Also observing the steeping process timing and water temperature allows you to bring the best out of your tea blend or herbal infusion, allowing you to savor the best taste of your freshly brewed tea. This tea maker set holds 17oz and comes in 3 separate components: Borosilicate Glass Mug - Able to withstand hot liquids that causes cracking and lightweight with a modern design compared to traditional glassware Silicone Band Edge Stainless Steel (304) Strainer - Holds loose tea leaves for steeping and easy removal from your brewed drink Borosilicate Glass Lid - Glass material that acts a lid to keep your drinks hot longer during steeping or as a coaster for your stainless steel infuser basket without leaving a stain on your table after steeping Usage: Add a good amount of loose tea blend into the infuser basket and place it where it will seat nicely on the tea mug. Add a good amount of loose tea blend into the infuser basket and place it where it will seat nicely on the tea mug. Pour hot water (88 - 100 Deg or 190 - 210 F), depending on what tea you are drinking up till 3/4 full and cover with the bamboo lid Pour hot water (88 - 100 Deg or 190 - 210 F), depending on what tea you are drinking up till 3/4 full and cover with the bamboo lid Steep for 2-3 minutes depending on the strength of tea brew that you want before removing the glass infuser basket Steep for 2-3 minutes depending on the strength of tea brew that you want before removing the glass infuser basket Drink it hot during winter or have it as iced during summer and enjoy! Drink it hot during winter or have it as iced during summer and enjoy! This simple yet useful all-in-one design is all you to brew your favorite tea blends anywhere you want. Definitely a great gift to any tea lover out there to enjoy their cup of hot or iced tea","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/7152V3cJWiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NimaTea","source_asin":"B074VDBJSV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074VDBJSV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074VDBJSV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
