window.products.push({"id":920865,"name":"25-In Evaporative Air Cooler, 2-IN-1 Swamp Cooler with Natural Cooling Humidifier, 3-Speed Wind, 70° Oscillation, 2 Ice Packs, 4L Water Tank, Portable","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hpjBYMVeS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❆【25Inch Portable Air Cooler】This 25Inch portable evaporative air cooler is convenient and easy to move. Top handle and side handle design and the 4 universal wheels at the bottom allow you to easily move the oversized air cooler to the bedroom, living room, kitchen or even outdoors. More convenient than traditional air conditioners and fans. ❆【Add Ice for Double Cooling】 Kimviento swamp cooler & tower fan has has many enjoyments. There is no water added to the cooler, just fan mode. When adding water, it is the mode of water circulation humidifying natural wind. Add water, then add ice cubes and 2 ice packs, it's a dual cooling mode, just as cool as an air conditioner. ❆【3 Speeds Modes】Kimviento evaporative cooler has three wind speeds. The room cooler has 3-Speeds are Low & Middle & High. The cooling fan 60dB low noise can make you more focused on sleep or work. This air cooler is suitable for home, bedroom, kitchen, office, and even outdoor use. ❆【4L Large Water Tank】Kimviento evaporative coolers has 4L/1Gallon large water tank, adding water once to keep it cool for a long time. Tower fan water circulation system, adding water and ice can make the hot and dry summer cool. Automatically stops evaporating when the water is used up. ❆【Saving Energy & 70° Oscillation】Compared with Expensive High-Power air conditioners, 65W evaporative coolers are more energy-saving and money-saving. The large water tank of the swamp cooler is filled with water, and after adding ice cubes and ice packs to the upper and lower layers, it is as cool as an air conditioner. Air cooler 70° wide oscillation horizontal automatically, blowing the cooling wind to greater coverage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51hpjBYMVeS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Kimviento","source_asin":"B09CGPF57F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-920865","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CGPF57F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CGPF57F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
